------FORMAL REQUIREMENTS-------
GOAL: Enable users to hear delightful snickers correlating to the nature of the sync when syncing with GiggleGit.
NON-GOAL: User ability to generate brand new snickers of their choosing.

NON-FUNCTIONAL 1: Usability
  FUNCTIONAL-REQUIREMENT 1: The snicker sounds will correlate to the status of the sync and how long the sync took. 
    The program will keep track of the sync status and longer or failed syncs will play more cruel snickers, while quick and successful syncs will play kind or short snickers.
  FUNCTIONAL-REQUIREMENT 2: The syncing process will include a visible progress bar to inform users of the sync's progress. Every 5–15 seconds, 
    a short snicker will play to maintain user engagement and provide feedback during longer syncs.

NON-FUNCTIONAL 2: Compatibility
  FUNCTIONAL-REQUIREMENT 1: SnickerSync will be compatible with major operating systems such as Windows, macOS, and Linux.
  FUNCTIONAL-REQUIREMENT 2: The SnickerSync feature will work seamlessly with both local and remote GiggleGit repositories to ensure that 
    no matter where users are syncing from (local or remote), they get the snicker experience.
